%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: NL-N41 Grayscale Test
%%Pages: 1
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 288 432
<< /PageSize [288 432] /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 15 scalefont setfont
0 setgray 18 408 moveto (NL-N41 GRAYSCALE TEST) show
/Helvetica findfont 9 scalefont setfont
18 390 moveto (4 x 6 in / 203 dpi / one copy) show
18 369 moveto (Continuous gradient: black to white) show
0 1 255 { /i exch def i 255 div setgray 18 i add 330 1 30 rectfill } for
0 setgray 18 311 moveto (16 gray levels: black to white) show
0 1 15 { /i exch def i 15 div setgray 18 i 16 mul add 270 16 30 rectfill } for
0 setgray 18 251 moveto (Constant patches: 25%, 50%, 75% gray) show
0.25 setgray 18 174 76 62 rectfill
0.5 setgray 108 174 76 62 rectfill
0.75 setgray 198 174 70 62 rectfill
0 setgray 18 156 moveto (Sharp black edges and small text should remain clear.) show
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 24 scalefont setfont
18 112 moveto (BLACK TEXT) show
0 setgray 18 67 112 24 rectfill
1 setgray /Helvetica-Bold findfont 12 scalefont setfont
22 74 moveto (WHITE TEXT) show
0 setgray /Helvetica findfont 9 scalefont setfont
18 40 moveto (Use Dither=FloydSteinberg or Dither=Ordered.) show
18 25 moveto (This pattern is not a scannable barcode.) show
showpage
%%EOF
